  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> are two independent events<br /><math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>⋅</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>49</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> … <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>∩</mo><msup><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>∩</mo><msup><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>26</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>49</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>⋅</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>26</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>49</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>42</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>49</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> … <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />From <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, we get,&nbsp;<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>B</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac></math> or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>B</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac></math><br />hence, the probability of the more probable event is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac></math>"
  }
